# Completion review: Auto fallback request lifetime

## Current TL006 test boundary (2026-10-31)

- Current fork-owned lifetime regression path:
  `tests/unit/auto-fallback-request-lifetime.test.ts`.
- Upstream stock test files were restored byte-for-byte to BASE. Historical
