  the old 499 cancellation and safety-stop results used temporary fixture edits
  and are not claimed for the restored files.
- The current five-file fork-owned Node acceptance passed 45/45 with zero
  failures or skips after migration; log:
  `/tmp/omni-auto-final-fork-node.log`. The independent review verified the
