## Selected native request lifetime (2026-10-31)

This receipt supersedes the custom repeat accounting, disabled identical-model
guard, and unbounded Auto lifetime claims above. The selected implementation is
only the native saved `comboDefaults.comboTimeoutMs=1200000` setting. Native
Auto retains its 30-attempt default (hard limit 200), existing three-identical-
model guard, finite target deadlines, cancellation, and native error handling.
No separate repeat budget, custom retry loop, or new error class is selected.
Native fallback still returns the next successful candidate response; exhausted
attempts return the aggregate OmniRoute failure and settle the queue as failed;
the existing cooldown filter applies on next selection.

The models.dev periodic refresh remains at its native 24-hour default; the
20-minute value is only the combo request budget. Historical settings and
offline regression results remain receipts and were not rerun for this docs-only
correction. Passive runtime proof remains open in `openspec/TODO.md`; this
package remains active and unarchived.
